    longDesc: 'In case of your need for Car Parking Epoxy Flooring in Bangalore, we offer durable, anti-skid, and oil-resistant epoxy coating, which is specifically designed to cover basement parking, multi-level car parks, residential apartments, commercial complexes, IT parks and industrial parking areas.\n\nCar parks are subjected to constant traffic of vehicles, friction of tyres, oil spills, and pressure of heavy loads. Normal concrete floors crack and produce dust and become dirty as time goes by. Our epoxy flooring systems are professional and produce a non-porous, high-strength protective layer that is beneficial in increasing durability, safety, and beauty.\n\nWe serve in Whitefield, Electronic City, Marathahalli, HSR Layout, Indiranagar, Yelahanka, Hebbal, KR Puram, and all the major Bangalore areas.',
    icon: 'epoxyflooring',
    sections: [
      { heading: 'Why Epoxy Flooring is Ideal for Parking Areas', content: 'Parking floors must be of high mechanical strength and chemical resistance. The concrete is covered with epoxy that helps to shield the concrete surface against permanent damage.\n\nThe Car Parking Epoxy Flooring has several important advantages:\n\nThick load-bearing capacity of vehicles and SUVs.\nVery good resistance to oil, grease, and brake fluid.\nRamps and slopes with an anti-skid textured finish.\nTyre mark resistance and abrasion.\nDust-proof and smooth surface.\nNo problem with maintenance and cleaning.\nMarking of parking slots and colour zoning.\n\nEpoxy flooring also increases the durability value, and besides increasing the reflection of light in the basement parking, which lowers power consumption.' },
      { heading: 'Our Car Parking Epoxy Flooring Services in Bangalore', content: 'We also provide tailor-made epoxy floors, in regard to traffic volume, inclination, and surface quality.\n\n1. Basement Parking Epoxy Flooring. — Usage: Ideal in residential and commercial basement parking locations. Free of dust, oil-resistant and performance-durable.\n2. Epoxy Coating Multi-Level Car Parking — Attracts shops, hospitals, and office buildings with constant traffic.\n3. This is the Anti-Skid Epoxy Flooring used on Ramps. — High-risk and inclined ramp special textured coating to avoid vehicle slipping.\n4. Heavy-Duty Epoxy Screed System. — In high-traffic density places and parking spots for commercial vehicles.\n5. Safety Zoning and Parking Line Marking. — Directional arrows, pedestrian paths, hazard marking and professional slot numbering.' },
      { heading: 'Technical Specifications We Offer', content: 'Thickness: 1mm to 3mm under load.\nSlip-resistant textured surface can be ordered.\nChemical-resistant topcoat\nUV coating (open parking optional)\nIndividual colour coding according to the client\'s demand.\n\nOur epoxy flooring products are calculated according to the site inspection and moisture level analysis to guarantee the adhesion and performance in the long term.' },
      { heading: 'Our Professional Installation Process', content: 'The most significant attribute of epoxy flooring is proper surface preparation.\n\nDetailed site inspection\nConcrete substrate moisture test.\nMechanical blasting or shot blasting.\nRepair of cracks and joint treatment.\nIndustrial vacuum cleaning\nApplicability of a primer to create a strong bond.\nInstallation of epoxy base coat.\nAnti-skid broadcast (where necessary)\nFinal topcoat sealing\nMarking and finishing of the parking lines.\n\nThis method is structured such that there is zero peeling, bubbling or premature coating failure.' },
      { heading: 'Why Choose Us for Car Parking Epoxy Flooring in Bangalore?', content: 'Senior flooring managers.\nMore than ten years of field experience.\nOver 500 flooring projects have been done.\nPremium branded epoxy materials have been used.\nTailor-made thickness depending on traffic.\nOpen pricing and quotation.\nOn-time project completion\nTechnical assistance after the installation.\n\nWe are aware of the moisture level and climate of Bangalore, and make sure that the moisture is controlled during installation.' },
      { heading: 'Maintenance & Lifespan', content: 'The epoxy parking floors need very little maintenance. The finish is maintained by sweeping and cleaning with a light detergent regularly. When taken care of, the flooring can last 5 or 10 years, depending on the traffic of the vehicles and the thickness of the flooring.' },
      { heading: 'Get a Free Site Inspection Today', content: 'Upgrade your parking space with professional Car Parking Epoxy Flooring in Bangalore that ensures durability, safety, and long-term performance.' },
    ],
