    shortDesc: 'Professional epoxy floor repair and restoration services in Bangalore addressing cracks, surface damage and worn coatings for industrial and commercial flooring systems.',
    longDesc: 'In case you need the Epoxy Floor Repair and restoration services in Bangalore, we offer the best services to fix damaged, cracked, worn-out, or peeling surfaces of epoxy flooring. Our team of professionals restores industrial, commercial, and parking epoxy floors to their initial strength, safety, and appearance.\n\nEpoxy flooring may become a victim of heavy traffic, chemical effects, dampness, improper installation, or substrate failure in the long run. Our affordable epoxy floor repair services will prolong the life of the flooring system with the least amount of downtime instead of a full replacement.\n\nWe operate in big industrial and commercial locations within Whitefield, Electronic City, Peenya, Hebbal, KR Puram, HSR Layout, Yelahanka, and other regions of Bangalore.',
    icon: 'epoxyflooring',
